WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.980
Once upon a time, in a far away land,

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:08.480
lived an old man and an old woman.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.780
The old man went to the mountains
to gather firewood.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.480
The old woman went to the river
to do the washing.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.490
Here.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.370
Your favorite, millet dumplings.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.250
Thank you, Mama.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.380
Take this.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:26.520
A sword?

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.130
But surely it's too expensive...

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.250
It's dangerous out there.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.380
You may encounter hostile creatures.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.510
Thank you, Papa.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:42.520
Still calling me "Papa," Peachy?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.150
Stop that now.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.270
I'm not a child any longer.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.280
My name now is Kibitsu-Hiko-no-Mikoto.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.100
Mama, Papa.

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.020
See you later.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:33.380
Thank you, human.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.540
A talking dog?!

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.380
Oh, calm down.

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:43.620
I just thanked you for the dumpling.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:48.890
You know, my own kind ostracizes me
because of this ability.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:52.150
Humans consider me
an ill omen and attack me.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.150
I have to pretend to be half-dead
to get any food at all!

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.660
You fooled me, then?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:03.940
You're a kind man.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.960
Don't just leave me here.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.480
Take me with you!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.930
Let's go, then.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.860
You're looking for your parents?

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:23.550
Tea

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.150
Yes.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.550
I want to ask them

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:30.060
why they put me in a peach
and sent me floating down the river.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.100
Are you sure they were telling
the truth about that?

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.750
Mama and Papa brought me up.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.720
They would never lie to me!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.070
Really?

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.070
I hope you find them, then.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:45.970
Agreed.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:49.900
An ogre!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.120
There's an ogre in the village!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.480
Run, Hiko!

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:21.710
Dying here won't do anyone any good!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.990
Don't you have to find your parents?!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.580
I... I'm seeking the parents
who abandoned me.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.250
How can I abandon these people here?

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.400
Stop!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:47.130
Oh?

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:51.770
Who are you, human,
who dares defy me?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.770
M-My name is... Kibitsu... Hiko... no...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.260
This is no time for getting tongue-tied!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.450
You fool!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.390
I... I said... my name is...

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:10.580
Kibitsu-Hiko...

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.660
Enough!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.630
My name is... this!

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.260
Peach Boy, born from a peach!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.030
I killed it.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.990
<i>I</i> killed it?!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.770
What is this power?

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.330
He killed it!

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.270
He killed the ogre!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.280
You're amazing!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.350
And so the rumors spread.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.660
The people suffering ogre attacks
in every town

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.700
asked Hiko for help,

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.290
and Hiko gave it.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.760
Help me!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:01.960
Please!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.000
Help me!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.050
Help!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.910
When hope appears, people cling to it.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.460
They never stop clinging to it.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.290
And so Hiko stopped
looking for his parents

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:21.560
and killed ogres instead.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.450
He was a kind man.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:31.950
Hiko thought that killing the ogres' leader
would end the battle,

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.540
and so he headed for their base
on Ogre Island.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.340
Do you resent me?

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.360
You used to be the master
of your own life.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.230
Yet you've let me drag you all this way?
All for one dumpling?

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:46.780
Hiko...

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.040
You've got it all wrong.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.470
I came along because I wanted to!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.590
All for one dumpling.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.100
There's something wrong
about seeing you smile.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.600
Hey!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.600
Sorry.

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:03.480
Smile, boy.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.360
I love seeing your smile.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.030
You beat me.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.500
I surrender.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:23.380
Do you remember the promise
you made before our duel?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:31.030
To leave this land and never return?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.760
Very well...

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.610
I'll keep my promise.

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.640
But remember this:

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:42.270
My defeat will bring the Kishin here.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.770
"Kishin"?

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:49.280
And so the land was freed from the ogres,

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:53.290
and Hiko was named a hero.

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:58.540
Hiko then made himself a home
deep in the mountains.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:03.300
He was worried about the Kishin
that the ogres' leader mentioned,

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:06.540
and he didn't want to get anyone
involved in the fight.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.050
Hey...

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:13.800
Shouldn't you go see
your mama and papa?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:18.560
They'd yell at me if I returned
without completing my original goal.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.070
That's what he said.

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:24.600
But deep down, he was lonely.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:29.070
I saw it in him,
more pronounced day by day.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.540
Until one day...

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.320
I don't see a horn,
but you're an ogre, aren't you?

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.280
Did you come here to kill me?

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.980
C-Certainly not...

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:44.080
I came with a request, in fact.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:47.070
My name is Gaki.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:52.850
My appearance let me infiltrate the village
and eat the people there.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.390
But...

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.350
I fell in love.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:04.940
I got married. I have a child.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.360
But... But I...

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.240
I ended up devouring my wife!

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:20.490
My request is: Please kill me!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.380
Please!

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:25.520
Peach Boy, the ogre slayer!

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.120
I can't do that.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.790
I can see you trembling.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:33.130
I can't fight my ogre instincts.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.510
If this keeps up,
I'll eat my son, as well!

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.230
What will happen to him,
with you gone?

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:41.140
I've left him with people I trust.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:49.940
He was a kind man to the end.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:55.530
You're concerned about that
ogre's child, aren't you?

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.190
Of course I am.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.920
I have to check on him, at least.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:01.480
Die, you monster!

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:08.170
Stop this!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.170
What kind of people
treat a child this way?

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:19.820
Are you all right?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.560
That thing is a monster!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.010
We took it in,

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:28.300
but it has a horn on its head!

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.580
It's an ogre disguised as a human!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.410
What does it matter
that he has a horn?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.120
Has he done anything—

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.090
Shut up!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:41.450
The ogres killed my child!

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:44.700
They ate him right in front of my eyes!

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.080
Mine, too!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.330
They killed my husband!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.320
My grandfather!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:50.370
My grandmother!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.280
My father!

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.580
My mother!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.720
Wait a minute!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.380
This child didn't do it himself!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.670
I'm... sorry.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.680
I'm sorry I was born.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.260
Hear me!

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.100
This child is under my protection!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:13.610
Hiko!

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:18.610
It's a hollow, self-serving display of kindness.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:21.960
But to fail to do so
simply would be evil.

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.790
I want to take responsibility,

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:26.020
no matter how you hate me for it.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.140
That's the day Mikoto met Hiko.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.000
Please kill me.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.260
I'm afraid of living.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:40.260
And I'm tired of hurting.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:41.900
Please...

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:44.890
Don't you want to avenge your father?

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.860
I'm the one who killed your father.

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.650
So you have a right to take revenge.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.400
Cut off my head, please!

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:05.400
Don't go worrying your mother now!

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:07.980
You're hungry, right?

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.790
Monster!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:18.340
Mikoto! Mikoto!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.180
Hiko!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:31.680
You aren't strong enough
to kill me now.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:34.690
Listen to me.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:38.080
You'll be far stronger
when you grow up.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:41.440
You'll be able to kill me then.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:47.010
But you won't be able
to survive that long alone.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.780
So I'll take care of you.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.750
No!

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:57.150
Do you want to return to your old life,
hated and beaten?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.400
I have sympathy for you.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.710
I'll treat you well.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:08.220
I will kill you!

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:10.970
Why won't you tell him?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.740
About what?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:13.480
Hiko!

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.900
Be quiet.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.360
You'll wake the boy.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.370
Just tell him!

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.900
Tell him that his father
asked you to kill him!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.380
Does he really need to hate you?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.360
Does he need to hate me?

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.700
Of course he does.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.460
Can you imagine it?

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:38.620
One day, his mother disappears,

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.370
I kill his father,

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:44.760
and the next thing he knows,
he's all alone because he has a horn.

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:48.190
What, whom is he supposed to hate?

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.960
Whose fault is it
that this happened to him?

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.390
Is he supposed to accept it
simply as his lot in life?

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.470
I can't neglect a crying child
before my eyes.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:03.080
And so, Hiko's life with Mikoto began.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.520
He taught him to read.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.230
You're better at this than me.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:10.930
He taught him to hunt.

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.400
Aim carefully before you release.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.410
Amazing!

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:18.920
To make fire...

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:25.320
Hiko. How have you not killed yourself yet?

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.560
Doesn't that feel great?

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.450
How's the water?

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.650
Am I allowed to ask your name yet?

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.260
I don't want to say it.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.820
My name's stupid.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:54.820
Yours is so cool.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:56.950
You want it, then?

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.460
You can have my name.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.960
Hiko and Mikoto were like brothers.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.380
I believed they'd found the
happiness each was due.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.300
But that would all soon end.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:23.360
We have arrived.
Lord Kishin, Noburega.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.310
Master Hiko?

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:32.400
Mikoto. Today is your coming-of-age.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.670
You remember what I said?

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.330
You can kill me now.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:39.080
Master Hiko... what are you...

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.500
I won't do it!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:49.130
Hiko. Why did you do that?

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:53.100
Are there ogres nearby?

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.890
No... they're still distant.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.490
But it's the Kishin.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.120
I've been looking for you.

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:05.900
I want to stay here forever.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:07.700
Please let me.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.320
Go on a journey.

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:16.810
There are people in this world
who will accept you.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.660
I'll be with you. Don't be afraid.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.690
Do you hate me?

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.360
I despise you.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:26.670
But...

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.140
Please don't hate me.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:35.080
Do you really think there are people
in the outside world who'll accept me?

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.290
Of course there are.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.390
But humans are cowards.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:43.230
They'll be hostile to people who are different,
or people with great power.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:46.310
I know.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.940
Let's make a promise.

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:49.400
A promise?

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.120
Smile.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.940
Whenever something bad happens,

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.550
whenever it's hard,
and you feel like crying,

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:57.550
brush it off with a smile.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.930
As long as you do that,
I will always protect you.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:04.640
I'll risk my life to save you.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.260
Together forever.

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:08.520
Right?

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:10.930
Sure.

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.540
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.220
I know this feeling.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:29.110
It's the same feeling
as when my father went missing!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.130
Wait!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.860
You mustn't go any farther.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.210
Master Hiko is there, isn't he?

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:37.110
Please let me through!

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:38.120
No!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.120
Return home!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.620
Move!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:42.810
I will not.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.880
Stay away! Mikoto!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.890
Am I... going to die?

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:07.270
It hasn't been a bad life.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.670
That's all right.

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:10.560
I've done enough.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.560
Don't worry.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:15.730
The child will be able to smile,
even without me.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:34.310
Getting your distance to finish me off?

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:37.880
As if I pose any threat...

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.680
I can't even move anymore.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.830
Ah, the moon's out?

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.660
It looks just like a millet dumpling.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.150
Why...

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.970
Why did you come here?

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.580
Look at you, crying...

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:00.910
Why...

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:04.160
I lost.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:07.140
Run. Hurry.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:08.100
No!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.160
Mikoto!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.170
No!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.520
I'm going to die.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:18.050
No... no!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:22.530
I can't even pat his head now.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.550
Then...

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:29.570
Mikoto, listen closely.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.080
You're about to head out
on your journey.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:38.920
You'll have to learn to accept yourself,
and other people.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.770
I can't do it.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:44.430
There's no point in living
without you.

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.960
Life's dark and scary
and full of people who hate me.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.990
Do you remember our promise?

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:54.870
If you smile, I'll protect you.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:58.710
I can't promise
we'll be together forever, but...

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:01.420
You can take my sword instead.

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.450
To protect yourself and others.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:09.660
To find what's important to you.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.730
To take pride in the fact
that you're alive.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:17.730
And... just so that
you can smile every day.

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:26.650
Master Hiko...

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.490
What is this?

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.500
Master Hiko?

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.310
Master Hiko...

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.740
I'm not a good boy.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.110
I'm always been very defiant.

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:55.270
There's something I've wanted.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.830
I've wanted...

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.650
For a very long time...

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:07.890
Master Hiko.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:09.900
Master Hiko.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:11.910
Master Hiko.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.290
Master Hiko.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:17.380
I love you.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:24.790
The battle between ogres
and humans will never end.

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:26.380
Yes, it will.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:40.890
Because I'll kill you all!

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.540
Master Hiko...

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:49.700
Did you say something?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.200
Talking in his sleep?

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:55.190
He's having a bad dream, perhaps.

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:57.970
Listen, Hiko...

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:02.710
Ever since that day,
Mikoto's had a hole in his heart.

00:22:03.410 --> 00:22:08.090
No amount of ogre-slaying
will ever fill that hole.

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:12.640
Not until he meets someone
he can share a smile with

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:14.970
from the bottom of his heart.

00:23:46.380 --> 00:23:49.200
Next time: "Horror and Resentment."
